Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 03:22:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/61] user-agent

User-agent + UA client-hints spoof; HeadlessChrome->Chrome product name.

On Linux the platform reported is Windows': the user agent's platform token, the client-hint platform and its version (19.0.0, Windows 11 24H2 and later) and navigator.platform (Win32), unless --use-chromium-defaults asks for stock Chromium.
